" text-anchor=\"middle\">25/2期</text><text x=\"267.5\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"8.5\" fill=\"#a99a76\" text-anchor=\"middle\">26/2期</text><text x=\"303\" y=\"25.2\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#7ba0cc\">8,813億</text><text x=\"303\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#7ba0cc\">売上</text><text x=\"4\" y=\"25.2\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#8a6f4d\">260億</text><text x=\"4\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#8a6f4d\">利益</text></svg></div><div class=\"finlg\"><span><i style=\"background:#cfe0f5\"></i>売上高（右軸）</span><span><i style=\"background:#c9661f\"></i>営業利益</span><span><i style=\"background:#178a5b\"></i>経常利益</span><span><i style=\"background:#7d55c7\"></i>純利益</span></div><div class=\"finrow finhead\"><span class=\"fp\"></span><span class=\"fc\">売上高</span><span class=\"fc\">営業利益</span><span class=\"fc\">純利益</span></div><div class=\"finrow\"><span class=\"fp\">26/2期</span><span class=\"fc\">8,813億円</span><span class=\"fc\">260億円</span><span class=\"fc\">188億円</span></div><div class=\"finrow\"><span class=\"fp\">25/2期</span><span class=\"fc\">8,505億円</span><span class=\"fc\">253億円</span><span class=\"fc\">179億円</span></div><div class=\"finrow\"><span class=\"fp\">24/2期</span><span class=\"fc\">8,097億円</span><span class=\"fc\">241億円</span><span class=\"fc\">169億円</span></div><div class=\"finrow\"><span class=\"fp\">23/2期</span><span class=\"fc\">7,654億円</span><span class=\"fc\">192億円</span><span class=\"fc\">133億円</span></div><div class=\"discnote\">グラフの棒・点にカーソルを合わせると数値が出ます。決算履歴は毎晩の実行で自動蓄積され、期間は時間とともに伸びていきます。古い年度はYahoo Financeの年次データで補完しています（この区間の経常利益は税引前利益で代用。決算短信の実測が入り次第、自動で置き換わります）。</div><div class=\"nhead\">ファンダメンタル指標</div><div class=\"fact\"><span>PER</span><span class=\"num\">46.6倍</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>PBR</span><span class=\"num\">1.50倍</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>ROE</span><span class=\"num\">3.2%</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>配当利回り</span><span class=\"num\">1.28%</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><span>時価総額</span><span class=\"num\">2,370億円</spa